      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I'M ALRIGHT (1) missed the frame last time when seventh (23.43) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Form here sound including eight wins. Can bounce back. RED AURA (2) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fifth and beaten 3 lengths (23.46) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings seven times from nine starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. SKINNY MARIE (3) was crowded for room and fell this course and distance last time. Has the ability and can measure up. TRICKLE (7) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at this track (23.27) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
